    "Data structures and interfaces": "classDiagram\n    class Config {\n        +gravity: float\n        +flap_impulse: float\n        +max_vy: float\n        +bird_x: float\n        +start_y: float\n        +pipe_speed: float\n        +pipe_width: float\n        +gap_height: float\n        +spawn_interval_ticks: int\n        +world_height: float\n        +world_ceiling: float\n        +world_floor: float\n    }\n\n    class Pipe {\n        +x: float\n        +gap_y: float\n        +width: float\n        +gap_height: float\n        +passed: bool\n        +right_edge() float\n        +step(speed: float)\n    }\n\n    class Game {\n        -config: Config\n        -state: str  // 'ready' | 'running' | 'game_over'\n        -bird_y: float\n        -bird_vy: float\n        -tick: int\n        -score: int\n        -_pipes: list~Pipe~\n        +__init__(config: Config, initial_pipes: list~Pipe~ = [])\n        +reset()\n        +flap()\n        +step()\n        +status() dict  // summary snapshot for demo/testing\n        +pipes_readonly() tuple~Pipe~  // includes passed pipes until removed off-screen\n    }\n\n    class Physics {\n        <<module>>\n        +clamp(value: float, lo: float, hi: float) float\n        +integrate_vy(vy: float, gravity: float, max_vy: float) float\n    }\n\n    class Scoring {\n        <<module>>\n        +is_pipe_scored(bird_x: float, pipe_right_edge: float, already_passed: bool) bool\n    }\n\n    class Collision {\n        <<module>>\n        +hits_bounds(y: float, ceiling: float, floor: float) bool\n        +hits_pipe(bird_x: float, bird_y: float, pipe: Pipe) bool\n    }\n\n    Game --> Config\n    Game --> Pipe\n    Game ..> Physics : uses\n    Game ..> Scoring : uses\n    Game ..> Collision : uses\n\n%% Full API behavioral rules (applies to Game, Scoring.is_pipe_scored):\n%% - States: 'ready', 'running', 'game_over' only.\n%% - flap(): in 'ready' atomically sets state to 'running' and immediately applies config.flap_impulse to vy; in 'running' reapplies the impulse; in 'game_over' no-op.\n%% - Step order while 'running': (1) vy := clamp(vy + gravity, -max_vy, max_vy); (2) y := y + vy; (3) move pipes; (4) score every unpassed pipe whose right edge is strictly left of config.bird_x exactly once using is_pipe_scored; 'passed' remains true while pipe remains in pipes_readonly(); (5) remove off-screen pipes only after scoring pass.\n%% - Scoring helper signature is fixed and pure: is_pipe_scored(bird_x: float, pipe_right_edge: float, already_passed: bool) -> bool.\n",
